  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/655/655-33.htm",
  "statuteText": "655:33 Disqualification of Candidates. –\n\nThe disqualification of a candidate to be voted for at a primary between the date of his filing and the day of the primary shall be dealt with as in the general election, as provided in RSA 655:38."
